WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.458 --> 00:00:01.835
I will take it.

00:00:08.842 --> 00:00:12.554
When there is such a clear difference
in abilities, it's so easy to take magic.

00:00:15.432 --> 00:00:18.351
My magic…

00:00:24.149 --> 00:00:26.985
Bastard… What did you do to Noelle?!

00:00:27.068 --> 00:00:29.571
Learn this the hard way.

00:00:30.280 --> 00:00:33.408
Water Creation Magic: Sea Dragon's Roar.

00:00:40.999 --> 00:00:43.710
That's Noelle's magic…

00:00:43.752 --> 00:00:44.711
Give it back to her!

00:01:00.018 --> 00:01:02.020
I'll defeat you here and now!

00:01:02.145 --> 00:01:05.565
So this is Anti-Magic,
the power to neutralize magic.

